[2.071005,"o","Usage: busybox [function] [arguments]...\n"]
[2.071022,"o","   or: busybox --list[-full]\n"]
[2.071039,"o","   or: busybox --install [-s] [DIR]\n"]
[2.071056,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[2.071073,"o","\n"]
[2.071091,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[2.071109,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[2.071126,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[2.071145,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
[2.071162,"o","\n"]
