[71.111513,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[71.11153,"o","\n"]
[71.111566,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[71.111599,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[71.111616,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
