[87.544096,"o","Usage: busybox [function] [arguments]...\n"]
[87.544114,"o","   or: busybox --list[-full]\n"]
[87.544131,"o","   or: busybox --install [-s] [DIR]\n"]
[87.54415,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[87.544167,"o","\n"]
[87.544183,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[87.5442,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[87.544217,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[87.544233,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
[87.54425,"o","\n"]
