[97.662677,"o","\n"]
[97.662693,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[97.662742,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[97.662762,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[97.66278,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
[97.662796,"o","\n"]
